<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10" style="transform:translateY(-8%) scale(1.08)"><span class="inline-block relative h-full w-full object-cover" data-base44-image="" data-base44-image-src="https://media.base44.com/images/public/6afb2e759cd11d1988ebd763/37c2b362a_generated_image.png"><span class="block relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><img alt="" data-sb-fallback="/assets/studybuddy-base44-exact/fallback/hero-dolphin-book.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/studybuddy-w14/art/37c2b362a_generated_image.jpg" style="display:block;position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"/></span></span></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 -z-10" style="background:linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(6,6,20,0.94) 0%, rgba(8,8,26,0.72) 45%, rgba(8,8,26,0.35) 100%)"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 grain"></div><div class="mx-auto flex min-h-[62vh] max-w-7xl items-center px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 sm:py-32"><div class="max-w-3xl"><div class="t-reveal eyebrow text-white/60" data-reveal="in" style="--reveal-delay:0ms">The StudyBuddy belief</div><blockquote class="t-reveal mt-6" data-reveal="in" style="--reveal-delay:100ms"><p class="display-xl text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,4.1rem)] leading-[1.02] text-white">Curiosity is not a reward for finishing the lesson.<span class="block italic text-white/70">It is the lesson.</span></p></blockquote><div class="t-reveal mt-8 max-w-xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/70" data-reveal="in" style="--reveal-delay:220ms">So we built a place where wandering is productive — where a learner can follow a question into a world, break something safely, and come back with evidence that they understood it.</div><div class="t-reveal mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-10 gap-y-4 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-white/45" data-reveal="in" style="--reveal-delay:320ms"><span>Worlds, not worksheets</span><span class="hidden h-3 w-px bg-white/20 sm:block"></span><span>Progress learners can read</span><span class="hidden h-3 w-px bg-white/20 sm:block"></span><span>Built with teachers</span></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-24 sm:py-32" id="story"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="eyebrow">How learning happens here</p><h2 class="display-xl mt-4 text-[clamp(2.2rem,4.5vw,3.6rem)] text-balance">Three steps, and then it's <span class="italic text-gradient">theirs.</span></h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">No onboarding quiz, no forced path. StudyBuddy is built so a learner can find their own way in — and keep it.</p></div></div><div class="mt-16 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.92fr_1.08fr]"><div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:self-start"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[30px] border border-border/60 bg-card/40"><div class="relative aspect-[4/5] w-full overflow-hidden sm:aspect-[5/4] lg:aspect-[4/5]"><span class="inline-block absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover transition-[opacity,transform] [transition-duration:900ms] [transition-timing-function:cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)]" data-base44-image="" data-base44-image-src="https://media.base44.com/images/public/6afb2e759cd11d1988ebd763/08b63d5c7_generated_image.png" style="opacity:1;transform:scale(1)"><span class="block relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><img alt="" data-sb-fallback="/assets/studybuddy-base44-exact/fallback/path-apps.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/studybuddy-w14/art/08b63d5c7_generated_image.jpg" style="display:block;position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"/></span></span><span class="inline-block absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover transition-[opacity,transform] [transition-duration:900ms] [transition-timing-function:cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)]" data-base44-image="" data-base44-image-src="https://media.base44.com/images/public/6afb2e759cd11d1988ebd763/7c0eecef4_generated_image.png" style="opacity:0;transform:scale(1.06)"><span class="block relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><img alt="" data-sb-fallback="/assets/studybuddy-base44-exact/fallback/path-parents.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/studybuddy-w14/art/7c0eecef4_generated_image.jpg" style="display:block;position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"/></span></span><span class="inline-block absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover transition-[opacity,transform] [transition-duration:900ms] [transition-timing-function:cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)]" data-base44-image="" data-base44-image-src="https://media.base44.com/images/public/6afb2e759cd11d1988ebd763/478ce63bd_generated_image.png" style="opacity:0;transform:scale(1.06)"><span class="block relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><img alt="" data-sb-fallback="/assets/studybuddy-base44-exact/fallback/path-teachers.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/studybuddy-w14/art/478ce63bd_generated_image.jpg" style="display:block;position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"/></span></span><span class="inline-block absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover transition-[opacity,transform] [transition-duration:900ms] [transition-timing-function:cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)]" data-base44-image="" data-base44-image-src="https://media.base44.com/images/public/6afb2e759cd11d1988ebd763/1bc165cdc_generated_image.png" style="opacity:0;transform:scale(1.06)"><span class="block relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><img alt="" data-sb-fallback="/assets/studybuddy-base44-exact/fallback/path-support.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/studybuddy-w14/art/1bc165cdc_generated_image.jpg" style="display:block;position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"/></span></span><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(8,8,26,0.1) 0%, rgba(8,8,26,0.45) 55%, rgba(8,8,26,0.94) 100%)"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-6"><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-white/55">Chapter <!-- -->01</p><p class="mt-2 display-xl text-2xl text-white">Number Galaxy</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-white/60">Mathematics</p></div></div><div class="p-6"><p class="eyebrow">The StudyBuddy loop</p><p class="mt-3 display-xl text-2xl leading-tight">Discover → Practise → <span class="italic text-primary">Grow</span></p><div class="mt-5 h-1 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-secondary"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-primary via-[#8b7bff] to-accent" style="width:0px"></div></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Scroll through the loop. Each stage is a real part of the learner experience.</p></div></div></div><div class="space-y-5"><article class="t-reveal group relative overflow-hidden rounded-[30px] border p-8 transition-[border-color,background-color] duration-500 sm:p-10 border-primary/45 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/10 via-card/60 to-card/20" data-reveal="in" style="--reveal-delay:0ms"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -right-12 -top-14 h-44 w-44 rounded-full blur-2xl transition-colors duration-700 bg-primary/25"></div><div class="relative flex items-start gap-6"><span class="display-xl text-5xl transition-colors duration-500 text-primary">01</span><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-2xl">Discover the world that fits</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-lg text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Curiosity leads. Learners wander through illustrated worlds, try a two-minute activity, and follow whatever pulls them in — no placement test, no pressure.</p><p class="mt-5 inline-flex rounded-full border border-border/70 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted-foreground">Worlds, not worksheets</p></div></div></article><article class="t-reveal group relative overflow-hidden rounded-[30px] border p-8 transition-[border-color,background-color] duration-500 sm:p-10 border-border/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-card/60 to-card/20" data-reveal="in" style="--reveal-delay:60ms"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -right-12 -top-14 h-44 w-44 rounded-full blur-2xl transition-colors duration-700 bg-primary/10"></div><div class="relative flex items-start gap-6"><span class="display-xl text-5xl transition-colors duration-500 text-primary/35">02</span><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-2xl">Practise inside the story</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-lg text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Skills are woven into play. A fraction becomes a fuel gauge, a metaphor becomes a bridge. Feedback is immediate, warm and specific.</p><p class="mt-5 inline-flex rounded-full border border-border/70 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted-foreground">Feedback in seconds</p></div></div></article><article class="t-reveal group relative overflow-hidden rounded-[30px] border p-8 transition-[border-color,background-color] duration-500 sm:p-10 border-border/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-card/60 to-card/20" data-reveal="in" style="--reveal-delay:120ms"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -right-12 -top-14 h-44 w-44 rounded-full blur-2xl transition-colors duration-700 bg-primary/10"></div><div class="relative flex items-start gap-6"><span class="display-xl text-5xl transition-colors duration-500 text-primary/35">03</span><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-2xl">Grow with a map of your own</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-lg text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Every session adds to a learning map that learners, families and teachers can actually read — visible progress, saved work, and goals that move.</p><p class="mt-5 inline-flex rounded-full border border-border/70 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted-foreground">Visible progress</p></div></div></article></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden border-y border-border/50 bg-card/20 py-24 sm:py-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="eyebrow">Made for every seat at the table</p><h2 class="display-xl mt-4 text-[clamp(2.2rem,4.5vw,3.6rem)] text-balance">Four journeys. <span class="italic text-gradient">One shared picture.</span></h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">A learner, a parent, a teacher and a self-directed adult each see a different StudyBuddy — built on the same progress.</p></div><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary" href="/roles">Compare the journeys<svg class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="mt-14 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div style="opacity:1;transform:none"><a class="group relative flex h-full min-h-[300px] flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-[26px] border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-6 transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-primary/40" href="/roles#student"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-40 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100" style="background:radial-gradient(80% 100% at 50% 0%, #8b7bff33, transparent 70%)"></div><div class="relative"><span class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl border" style="border-color:#8b7bff55;background:#8b7bff1a;color:#8b7bff"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-graduation-cap h-5 w-5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z"></path><path d="M22 10v6"></path><path d="M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5"></path></svg></span><h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Student</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Explore, play, keep a map of everything you learn.</p></div><ul class="relative mt-6 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background:#8b7bff"></span>Pick any world and start in under a minute</li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background:#8b7bff"></span>Save favourite activities into folders</li></ul><span class="relative mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-foreground/80">View journey<svg class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div><div style="opacity:1;transform:none"><a class="group relative flex h-full min-h-[300px] flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-[26px] border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-6 transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-primary/40" href="/roles#parent"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-40 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100" style="background:radial-gradient(80% 100% at 50% 0%, #37d6c433, transparent 70%)"></div><div class="relative"><span class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl border" style="border-color:#37d6c455;background:#37d6c41a;color:#37d6c4"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-users h-5 w-5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg></span><h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Parent / Family</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">See the week at a glance, without hovering.</p></div><ul class="relative mt-6 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background:#37d6c4"></span>One shared view across children</li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background:#37d6c4"></span>Weekly rhythm instead of minute-by-minute tracking</li></ul><span class="relative mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-foreground/80">View journey<svg class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div><div style="opacity:1;transform:none"><a class="group relative flex h-full min-h-[300px] flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-[26px] border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-6 transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-primary/40" href="/roles#teacher"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-40 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100" style="background:radial-gradient(80% 100% at 50% 0%, #59b7ff33, transparent 70%)"></div><div class="relative"><span class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl border" style="border-color:#59b7ff55;background:#59b7ff1a;color:#59b7ff"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-school h-5 w-5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M14 22v-4a2 2 0 1 0-4 0v4"></path><path d="m18 10 3.447 1.724a1 1 0 0 1 .553.894V20a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7.382a1 1 0 0 1 .553-.894L6 10"></path><path d="M18 5v17"></path><path d="m4 6 7.106-3.553a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0L20 6"></path><path d="M6 5v17"></path><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2"></circle></svg></span><h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Teacher</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Assign a world, then watch understanding land.</p></div><ul class="relative mt-6 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background:#59b7ff"></span>Group learners into classes and cohorts</li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background:#59b7ff"></span>Assign worlds or single activities</li></ul><span class="relative mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-foreground/80">View journey<svg class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div><div style="opacity:1;transform:none"><a class="group relative flex h-full min-h-[300px] flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-[26px] border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-6 transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-primary/40" href="/roles#independent-learner"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-40 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100" style="background:radial-gradient(80% 100% at 50% 0%, #ffb45733, transparent 70%)"></div><div class="relative"><span class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl border" style="border-color:#ffb45755;background:#ffb4571a;color:#ffb457"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-compass h-5 w-5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></span><h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Independent Learner</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Build a study habit that doesn't feel like homework.</p></div><ul class="relative mt-6 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background:#ffb457"></span>Self-paced paths with no enrolment</li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full" style="background:#ffb457"></span>Focus sessions from Focus Flow</li></ul><span class="relative mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-foreground/80">View journey<svg class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-24 sm:py-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="grid items-center gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr]"><div><p class="eyebrow">For schools</p><h2 class="display-xl mt-4 text-[clamp(2.2rem,4.4vw,3.5rem)] text-balance">A school layer that knows <span class="italic text-gradient">its own boundaries.</span></h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-lg text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Bring StudyBuddy into classrooms without losing control of your data. Onboarding is guided, permissions are explicit, and each school works inside its own walls.</p><div class="mt-10 space-y-5"><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="mt-0.5 grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-card/50 text-primary"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-users h-4 w-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg></span><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Organization-scoped by design</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Every staff view is limited to its own school. One school can never read another's records.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="mt-0.5 grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-card/50 text-primary"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-key-round h-4 w-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z"></path><circle cx="16.5" cy="7.5" fill="currentColor" r=".5"></circle></svg></span><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Roles you can actually explain</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Owner, school coordinator, teacher and learner — each with a defined set of permissions.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="mt-0.5 grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-card/50 text-primary"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-shield-check h-4 w-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></span><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Deny by default</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Access is refused unless a rule explicitly allows it, and student records are never public.</p></div></div></div><a class="group mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-border/80 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:border-primary/50 hover:text-primary" href="/for-schools">School onboarding &amp; inquiry<svg class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="relative" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -inset-6 -z-10 rounded-[40px] bg-primary/10 blur-3xl"></div><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[30px] border border-border/70 bg-gradient-to-br from-card to-background"><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border/60 px-6 py-4"><div><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted-foreground">School workspace</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold">Riverside Academy</p></div><span class="rounded-full border border-accent/40 bg-accent/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent">Sample</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 divide-x divide-border/60 border-b border-border/60"><div class="px-5 py-5"><p class="display-xl text-2xl">12</p><p class="mt-1 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted-foreground">Staff</p></div><div class="px-5 py-5"><p class="display-xl text-2xl">248</p><p class="mt-1 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted-foreground">Learners</p></div><div class="px-5 py-5"><p class="display-xl text-2xl">9</p><p class="mt-1 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted-foreground">Classes</p></div></div><div class="space-y-3 p-6"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card/60 p-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><p class="text-sm font-medium">Year 5 · Number Galaxy</p><span class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">18 of 24 completed</span></div><div class="mt-3 h-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-secondary"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-accent" style="width:62%"></div></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card/60 p-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><p class="text-sm font-medium">Year 6 · Curious Lab</p><span class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">11 of 22 completed</span></div><div class="mt-3 h-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-secondary"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-accent" style="width:48%"></div></div></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card/60 p-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4"><p class="text-sm font-medium">Reading Reef · Intervention</p><span class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">8 of 9 completed</span></div><div class="mt-3 h-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-secondary"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-accent" style="width:88%"></div></div></div><p class="pt-1 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">Demo data. Real student records are never seeded into this prototype.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden py-24 sm:py-32"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 aurora opacity-40"></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[0.95fr_1.05fr] lg:items-center"><div class="relative"><div class="rounded-[30px] border border-border/70 glass p-6 sm:p-8"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted-foreground">Personal learning panel</p><span class="rounded-full border border-accent/40 bg-accent/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent">Sample</span></div><div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-background/60 p-5"><div class="flex items-end justify-between"><div><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">This week's goal</p><p class="display-xl mt-1 text-3xl">3 of 4 sessions</p></div><span class="text-xs text-primary">75%</span></div><div class="mt-4 h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-secondary"><div class="h-full w-3/4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-accent"></div></div></div><div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-background/50 p-4"><p class="display-xl text-2xl">14</p><p class="mt-1 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted-foreground">Saved activities</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-background/50 p-4"><p class="display-xl text-2xl">5</p><p class="mt-1 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted-foreground">Folders</p></div></div><div class="mt-4 space-y-2"><div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-border/50 px-4 py-3"><span class="text-xs text-foreground/85">Number Galaxy · Fractions</span><span class="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground">2h ago</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-border/50 px-4 py-3"><span class="text-xs text-foreground/85">Word Garden · Story seeds</span><span class="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground">Yesterday</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-border/50 px-4 py-3"><span class="text-xs text-foreground/85">Studio Nova · Rhythm</span><span class="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground">3 days ago</span></div></div></div></div><div><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="eyebrow">Personalised, gently</p><h2 class="display-xl mt-4 text-[clamp(2.2rem,4.5vw,3.6rem)] text-balance">Built around one learner, <span class="italic text-gradient">not one average.</span></h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">No leaderboards, no comparison engines. Personalisation here means the shelf remembers what you loved and the dashboard remembers what you were doing.</p></div></div><div class="mt-10 space-y-6"><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="mt-0.5 grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-card/50 text-accent"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-target h-4 w-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg></span><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold">Goals that stay small</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">A weekly target the learner sets themselves — three sessions, one chapter, one new world. Progress fills quietly in the corner.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="mt-0.5 grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-card/50 text-accent"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-folder-open h-4 w-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 14 1.5-2.9A2 2 0 0 1 9.24 10H20a2 2 0 0 1 1.94 2.5l-1.54 6a2 2 0 0 1-1.95 1.5H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H18a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path></svg></span><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold">Folders for everything made</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Finished work is kept, not discarded. Learners build folders for a subject, a project, or a private collection.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-4"><span class="mt-0.5 grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-card/50 text-accent"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-history h-4 w-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path><path d="M12 7v5l4 2"></path></svg></span><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold">Pick up where you left off</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Recently used apps and saved activities sit on the dashboard, so returning never starts from a blank page.</p></div></div></div><a class="group mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary" href="/dashboard">See the learner dashboard<svg class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class="relative border-t border-border/50 py-24 sm:py-32"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="eyebrow">Questions, answered</p><h2 class="display-xl mt-4 text-[clamp(2.2rem,4.5vw,3.6rem)] text-balance">The things <span class="italic text-gradient">grown-ups ask.</span></h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">If something isn't covered here, the school inquiry form on the For Schools page reaches a real inbox.</p></div></div><div class="w-full" data-orientation="vertical"><div class="border-b border-border/60" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left text-[15px] font-medium hover:no-underline" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_d5daq_" type="button">Is StudyBuddy a school curriculum?<svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_d5daq_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_2d5daq_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><p class="px-0 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">No. StudyBuddy is a learning companion. Activities are designed alongside educators to build understanding, but they complement a curriculum rather than replace it.</p></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/60" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left text-[15px] font-medium hover:no-underline" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_l5daq_" type="button">What ages is it built for?<svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_l5daq_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_2l5daq_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><p class="px-0 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The catalogue spans ages 5 to 16, and every app card shows its age range. Younger learners get simpler navigation and larger controls; older learners get deeper challenges.</p></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/60" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left text-[15px] font-medium hover:no-underline" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_t5daq_" type="button">How is student data protected?<svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_t5daq_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_2t5daq_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><p class="px-0 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Student records are never public and never seeded with real children's information. Access is scoped to the signed-in learner, their guardian or their school — enforced on the server, not just hidden in the interface.</p></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/60" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left text-[15px] font-medium hover:no-underline" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_155daq_" type="button">Can a school try this before committing?<svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_155daq_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_355daq_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><p class="px-0 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. Send an inquiry through the For Schools page and we'll set up a scoped sandbox organization for your team to explore with demo learners.</p></div></div><div class="border-b border-border/60" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><h3 class="flex" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed"><button aria-expanded="false" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 py-5 text-left text-[15px] font-medium hover:no-underline" data-orientation="vertical" data-radix-collection-item="" data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1d5daq_" type="button">Do parents need their own account?<svg class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1d5daq_" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" hidden="" id="radix-_R_3d5daq_" role="region" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><p class="px-0 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Parents and guardians get a family view: progress, screen-time rhythms and saved work, without editing the learner's account.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden py-24 sm:py-32"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 -z-10"><span class="inline-block absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-35" data-base44-image="" data-base44-image-src="https://media.base44.com/images/public/6afb2e759cd11d1988ebd763/0e88f06f6_generated_image.png"><span class="block relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><img alt="" data-sb-fallback="/assets/studybuddy-base44-exact/fallback/path-apps.webp" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/studybuddy-w14/art/0e88f06f6_generated_image.jpg" style="display:block;position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"/></span></span><div class="absolute inset-0 aurora opacity-70"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-background/45"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-40 bg-gradient-to-t from-background to-transparent"></div></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 text-center sm:px-8"><div class="relative mx-auto h-24 w-24"><span class="inline-block relative h-full w-full object-contain" data-base44-image="" data-base44-image-src="/assets/studybuddy-base44-exact/originals/5bf1ca197_studybuddy-icon-512.png"><span class="block relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden"><img alt="" data-sb-fallback="/assets/studybuddy-base44-exact/logo.png" decoding="async" loading="eager" src="/assets/studybuddy-base44-exact/originals/5bf1ca197_studybuddy-icon-512.png" style="display:block;position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height